    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 24 Adare Park. This stunning three bedroom extended mid terrace family home has been beautifully presented by the current owners. This lovely property is sure to impress an array of buyers.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises entrance hallway, open plan living / dining room and kitchen/breakfast area. A utility and bathroom complete the ground floor accommadtion. The first floor accommodation comprises three bedrooms and an ensuite.\n\nThe front garden is low maintenance and offers off street car parking. There is shared side access leading to the private rear garden. Here a self contained unit can be found offering a flexible space for home office or guest bedroom. It is complete with small kitchen and bathroom.\n\nAdare Park is also close to all of the amenities Coolock has to offer. Dublin Bus service the area with frequent bus routes to and from the City Centre. There is an excellent selection of schools in the locality in addition to numerous sporting & leisure facilities making it the ideal location for a family home. Northside S.C. and The Omni S.C are closeby while Beaumont Hospital, Dublin City University and Dublin Airport are all only a short drive away. The M1 & M50 are also very easy to access.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three bed mid terrace property</li><li> Extending to approx. 96sqm</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Shared side access</li><li> Self contained unit to the rear</li><li> Excellent location</li><li> Turn-key condition</ul>"
      },
